    "message": "Suggested Alternatives\nLeadSoft.Adapter.Azure.EntraID\n\nAdditional Details\nThis package has been superseded by LeadSoft.Adapter.Azure.EntraID.\n\nThe new package introduces dedicated IAzureSSO interface, improved dependency injection via AddScopedAzureSSO() or AddSingletonAzureSSO(), full XML documentation in pt-BR, and MS EntraID SSO support as a first-class citizen.\n\nPlease migrate to LeadSoft.Adapter.Azure.EntraID to continue receiving updates and support.",
